AltFire:
7H37 D 0 A_JumpIfInventory("TidalShieldFlag",1,"WaveAttack")
7H37 D 0 A_PlaySound("misc/waterslide",1)
7H37 BECFBE 2
7H37 D 0 A_GiveInventory("TidalShieldFlag",1)
Goto ReadyT2
