BotCheck:
7H37 D 0 A_GiveInventory("FlowEnergyAmmo",25)
7H37 D 0 A_Jump(6,"BotFireX")
7H37 D 0 A_Jump(24,"BotSwap")
7H37 D 0 A_JumpIfInventory("TidalShieldFlag",1,2)
